    id: 28,
    tag: '隐私安全',
    q: '专线机场会保存用户的上网浏览隐私日志吗？',
    a: '正规的海外运营专线服务商普遍遵循行业通行的「零日志记录（No-Logs Policy）」守则。用户网络请求在物理光纤内部均经过高强度端到端加密封装，专线机房节点服务器普遍采用只读的 RAM 内存无盘系统实时转发，绝不持久化存储任何用户的真实公网访问记录与隐私数据，充分捍卫通信自由。',
  },
  {
    id: 29,
    tag: '换机迁移',
    q: '换了新电脑或手机，之前的机场订阅链接还能继续使用吗？',
    a: '完全可以。机场订阅是一串永久绑定你个人账户权益的云端托管 URL。更换新电脑或手机后，只需在新设备上安装对应的代理客户端（如 Clash Verge 或小火箭），登录机场后台重新复制该链接导入即可，历史购买的流量包配额、到期时间与节点参数将实现毫秒级全量云端同步，无需重复付费。',
  },
  {
    id: 30,
    tag: '闭眼推荐',
    q: '2026年长期稳定不翻车的闭眼入专线机场有哪些推荐？',
    a: '综合社长实验室连续多年跟踪与晚高峰实测探针，2026年公认长期稳定、口碑过硬的梯子首推 闪电鼠（综合榜首，IEPL+内网专线全绿满跑，¥8/月）与 大佬云（老牌 6 年旗舰，原生住宅解封，¥8/月）；追求游戏低延迟首推 神行加速；追求极致高性价比首选 云界线 与 环球梯。',
  },
];

// Schema for all 30 FAQs
const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: airportFaqs.map((item) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: item.q,
    acceptedAnswer: {
      '@type': 'Answer',
      text: item.a,
    },
  })),
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="专线百科科普与机场推荐知识库 | 10 大核心深度长文专题全览"
  description="机场社长专线百科与知识库：围绕「机场推荐」打造的 10 大核心 SEO 深度长文专题，涵盖 IPLC/IEPL 专线底层原理解析、ChatGPT/Claude 住宅 IP 防封、4K/8K 奈飞流媒体、外服电竞低延迟与防跑路避坑全景。"
>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: '全部专题', href: '/' }, { label: '专线百科科普' }]} />

    <header class="my-8 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-brand-700 text-xs font-semibold mb-3">
        📖 专线百科科普 · 10 大核心深度长文专题库
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-ink-heading tracking-tight leading-tight">
        科学上网与物理专线技术百科
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-ink-body text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        听不懂中转、专线、BGP 和协议？社长用大白话带你拆解计算机网络底层的真实逻辑，深度剖析 10 大核心出海与翻墙实战专题。
      </p>

      <!-- Direct Answer Snippet -->
      <div class="text-left bg-brand-50/70 border-l-4 border-brand-600 p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-r-xl my-6 text-sm text-ink-heading leading-relaxed font-medium shadow-sm">
        <strong class="text-brand-700 font-bold block mb-1">💡 专线与普通中转有什么区别？社长 30 秒大白话解答：</strong>
        IPLC 与 IEPL 专线通过跨境物理海底光缆点对点内网互联，数据完全不经过国家防火墙 (GFW) 检查，抗封锁能力与晚高峰稳定性均为行业第一（AAA+）；普通公网中继则通过公网转发，成本低廉但在晚高峰极易遭遇 30% 以上丢包卡顿。
      </div>
    </header>

    <AffiliateDisclosure variant="banner" />

    <!-- Glossary Grid -->
    <section class="my-10">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-heading flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🔍</span> <span>核心名词定义通识</span>
        </h2>
        <span class="text-xs text-ink-muted">高频技术术语速查</span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {glossary.map((g) => (
          <div class="bg-white border border-surface-border rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-card hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-ink-heading flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-600"></span>
              <span>{g.term}</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-body leading-relaxed">
              {g.def}
            </p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- 10 大核心 SEO/GEO 深度长尾专题长文矩阵 (按序全量展示) -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <section class="my-14" id="topic-cluster">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-surface-border">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-700 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono mb-1">
            TOPIC CLUSTER MATRIX
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-ink-heading tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>📚</span> <span>围绕「机场推荐」10 大核心深度长尾专题长文全览</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-muted mt-1">
            每篇正文 1500~2000 字密集实测干货，包含 GEO 前置决策表、晚高峰实测数据、配套 FAQ 与结构化 Schema
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-50 text-brand-700 font-bold text-xs border border-brand-200 shrink-0">
          全量收录 10 篇
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        {topicArticles.map((g) => {
          if (!g) return null;
          const badgeText = categoryPills[g.slug] || '深度专题';
          return (
            <article class="bg-white border border-surface-border hover:border-brand-400 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-card hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
              <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-brand-50 text-brand-700 font-mono font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center border border-brand-200">
                      #{g.serialNo}
                    </span>
                    <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface-subtle text-brand-700 border border-surface-border font-bold text-[11px]">
                      {badgeText}
                    </span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="font-mono text-ink-muted text-xs">阅读 {g.data.readingTime}</span>
                </div>

                <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-ink-heading group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors leading-snug">
                  <a href={`/guides/${g.slug}`}>
                    {g.data.title}
                  </a>
                </h3>

                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-body line-clamp-3 leading-relaxed">
                  {g.data.description}
                </p>

                <!-- Tags list -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap pt-1 text-xs">
                  {g.data.tags.slice(0, 3).map((tag: string) => (
                    <span class="text-[11px] text-ink-muted font-mono bg-surface-subtle px-2 py-0.5 rounded">
                      #{tag}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="pt-4 mt-5 border-t border-surface-border flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                <span class="text-ink-muted font-mono text-[11px]">
                  更新：{g.data.updatedDate}
                </span>
                <a
                  href={`/guides/${g.slug}`}
                  class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-sm transition-all group-hover:translate-x-0.5"
                >
                  阅读全文 ➔
                </a>
              </div>
            </article>
          );
        })}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Bottom Fast Navigation -->
    <div class="my-12 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-subtle border border-brand-200 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="space-y-1 text-center sm:text-left">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-ink-heading">
          💻 正在寻找客户端配置保姆级教程？
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">
          查看 Windows / Mac / iOS / Android 全平台客户端教程库，手把手教你配置 Clash、小火箭与 Sing-box。
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/clients"
        class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-sm transition-all shrink-0"
      >
        进入客户端教程库 ➔
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- 用户指定位置：加入 30 个高热搜高权重「机场推荐」FAQ 矩阵 -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <section class="my-14" id="airport-faq-section">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-surface-border">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-50 border border-brand-200 text-brand-700 text-xs font-semibold mb-2">
            💡 权威实测 · 疑难解答
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-ink-heading tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>❓</span> <span>2026 翻墙机场推荐与选购高频常见问题 (FAQ 30 问)</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-muted mt-1">
            覆盖专线挑选、AI防封、4K流媒体、学生党性价比、外服电竞及排障鉴毒全维度，每问均经社长自费实测求证。
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-subtle text-ink-heading border border-surface-border shrink-0 self-start sm:self-auto">
          收录 30 个核心问答
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Accordion Container (2 Columns on large screens, 1 on mobile) -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4" id="faq-accordion-grid">
        {airportFaqs.map((faq) => (
          <details class="group bg-white border border-surface-border hover:border-brand-300 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 cursor-pointer select-none">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-brand-50 text-brand-700 font-mono font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-brand-200 mt-0.5">
                  Q{faq.id}
                </span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink-heading group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors leading-snug">
                    {faq.q}
                  </h3>
                  <span class="inline-block mt-1 text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-subtle text-ink-muted border border-surface-border">
                    #{faq.tag}
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-ink-muted group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0 group-open:rotate-180 mt-1"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
              >
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-surface-border text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-body leading-relaxed pl-8">
              <p>{faq.a}</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

  <!-- Schema.org FAQPage Structured Data -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />
</BaseLayout>
